<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In A.1 Benchmarks ‣ Appendix A Benchmarks and reward models ‣ IRIS: Intrinsic Reward Image Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">WISE <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<span class="ltx_ref">Niu et al., 2025</span>)</cite></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
